                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                        "entry_id": "79381095-8741-30a4-8fef-65c3027aba41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vertreter der prähistorischen, in Höhlen lebenden Menschen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f512b8a3-53d2-4483-8c5c-daf78e57373f",
                                "sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                                "text": "„Beides sei deine Pflicht, sagst du, aber du fragst dich selber, wie man das Zweite tun kann, ohne das Erste zu unterlassen. Was denkst du , wenn du Bilder siehst (weil du, wie praktisch alle Ceuties, ja noch nie dort warst), wie die Subsaharianer einen Katzensprung vom Zentrum Ceutas entfernt wie Höhlenmenschen hausen; kaum zu essen haben, dem Wetter wie Tiere ausgesetzt? Du redest davon, dass die Welt halt nicht gerecht sei, von globalen Zusammenhängen, von der Machtlosigkeit des Einzelnen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5d2ea1e-9c50-40bb-a2d9-334a7eaa9dd5",
                                "sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                                "text": "„Der Höhlenmensch war freundlich zu dem Jungen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0abe6a3-aeff-4d7f-952c-9dcf8295cdf3",
                                "sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                                "text": "„Sie hatten in der Schule über Höhlenmenschen gesprochen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6604b7d-cd7d-4109-b638-29b19d0123d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "79381095-8741-30a4-8fef-65c3027aba41",
                        "source_sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Vertreter der prähistorischen, in Höhlen lebenden Menschen",
                        "target_lang_word": "caveman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caveman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3067496-8226-340d-9b4d-5a3b1e4c68c8",
                                        "entry_id": "7648ef34-7a8b-3d75-801d-ab8b182f998f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An early human or closely related species, popularly held to reside in caves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f6eec96-a65c-40ed-bc28-f56880d8056a",
                                                "sense_id": "d3067496-8226-340d-9b4d-5a3b1e4c68c8",
                                                "text": "The political cartoon showed the politician as a caveman, clubbing the budget depicted as a mammoth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d79a8506-a6e3-4350-832b-5f8c3e30ec0c",
                                                "sense_id": "d3067496-8226-340d-9b4d-5a3b1e4c68c8",
                                                "text": "CAVEMAN DIET\nThe creators of this nutrition plan believe that cavemen and cavewomen were lean and healthy because of the all-natural foods they ate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76093d52-6303-4a53-ae92-13640571e550",
                                                "sense_id": "d3067496-8226-340d-9b4d-5a3b1e4c68c8",
                                                "text": "And who could forget those ads that featured sophisticated cavemen who were insulted—in a parody on political correctness—by “insensitive” offenders who implied that some action was “so easy, a caveman could do it.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54d2adc0-210d-484b-8f9a-1d9eff7a710a",
                                                "sense_id": "d3067496-8226-340d-9b4d-5a3b1e4c68c8",
                                                "text": "For, in essence, the caveman concept implies the abhorrent—undignified human bestiality and a disquieting association with apelike ancestors. Cavemen have represented Darwin′s repugnant evolutionary ideals and even suggest civilisation′s tenuousness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac659443-5989-3e76-816d-10f6de05adaf",
                                        "entry_id": "7648ef34-7a8b-3d75-801d-ab8b182f998f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with backward, primitive behavior, opinions, or interests."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a91b16fe-022e-4863-a9e4-245cc1dc147e",
                                                "sense_id": "ac659443-5989-3e76-816d-10f6de05adaf",
                                                "text": "You think your Caveman is always chasing you for sex. Well, he is."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "250ae892-320c-340d-852b-4605164d3b27",
                                        "entry_id": "7648ef34-7a8b-3d75-801d-ab8b182f998f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with backward, primitive behavior, opinions, or interests.",
                                            "A brutish person, one who behaves in a rough, uncivilized way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85936056-d204-4cd2-8795-4f5f8383d7a8",
                                                "sense_id": "250ae892-320c-340d-852b-4605164d3b27",
                                                "text": "The football squad was made up of cavemen who were responsible for trashing many a locker room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69e483ce-2dde-4ab8-95cc-6ac42fe31a47",
                                                "sense_id": "250ae892-320c-340d-852b-4605164d3b27",
                                                "text": "\"Bless you, he would think nothing of throwing you downstairs if you have a disagreement. He is a primitive cave-man in a lounge suit. I can see him with a club in one hand and a jagged bit of flint in the other.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ed71bde-d4dc-34ef-b1f2-e5f72a8757e0",
                                        "entry_id": "7648ef34-7a8b-3d75-801d-ab8b182f998f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with backward, primitive behavior, opinions, or interests.",
                                            "Someone, especially a man, who has regressive, old-fashioned attitudes, particularly with regard to women; someone opposed to change or modernity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2127ae93-c244-4192-a029-05c75deea867",
                                                "sense_id": "5ed71bde-d4dc-34ef-b1f2-e5f72a8757e0",
                                                "text": "Old Sven is a bit of a caveman; he figures giving women the right to vote was a bad idea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d37433da-63b8-44a7-99b1-29f108b8c0ac",
                                                "sense_id": "5ed71bde-d4dc-34ef-b1f2-e5f72a8757e0",
                                                "text": "Pat is a real caveman when it comes to tech, and refuses to get a smartphone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "929b6db7-28c6-492c-b00c-20b82da5fd4d",
                        "source_entry_id": "79381095-8741-30a4-8fef-65c3027aba41",
                        "source_sense_id": "d8b3c339-73ba-3d39-ab27-747ee86372e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Vertreter der prähistorischen, in Höhlen lebenden Menschen",
                        "target_lang_word": "homme des cavernes",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "homme des cavernes",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f77763c4-050f-3e3f-9d30-ebbc43843029",
                                        "entry_id": "267193e9-5909-3b7f-aa1f-a1423e95be04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Humain de l’époque paléolithique qui vivait dans des cavernes, des grottes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Préhistoire"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62f237df-675e-3a5f-9428-15ba21dca083",
                                        "entry_id": "267193e9-5909-3b7f-aa1f-a1423e95be04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Homme rustre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6208c859-381f-4830-818a-ee311a305004",
                                                "sense_id": "62f237df-675e-3a5f-9428-15ba21dca083",
                                                "text": "Mais le maître des Hautes Héez dédaigne toute convenance. Qu’il garde sa barbe toute entière, mais qu’il la cultive. Elle lui donne l’air d’un Robinson, d’un homme des cavernes, voire d’un hors-la-loi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2670345d-db9d-49fe-ba96-1b3d14fb3f88",
                                                "sense_id": "62f237df-675e-3a5f-9428-15ba21dca083",
                                                "text": "Onawa voyait en lui le tout petit enfant, derrière son masque hirsute d’homme des cavernes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
